claim.claim-text:
setting (705) an antenna (152, 224, 304, 404) of the antenna system to an initial angular position towards a target (112, 208, 540), the initial angular position being defined in a local tangent plane relative to the antenna system and the target;
adjusting (710) a pointing direction of the antenna (152, 224, 304, 404) from the initial angular position to a plurality of angular positions in a sweep operation;
measuring a signal metric of signals communicated between the antenna and the target at each of the plurality of angular positions of the sweep operation;
recording (715) a number of times the sweep operation has been executed;
determining (720) whether a yaw rate measured by an inertial navigation system, INS, (102, 270, 552, 604) satisfies a threshold yaw rate level;
determining (725) whether the number of times the sweep operation was executed satisfies a threshold operation level; and
selecting a scan offset angle based on the measured signal metrics.
